{"name": "Liturnian", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Come forth Pilgrim</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Lightfolk of Luxheim are in need</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Shine our Light where we can't reach</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829630/extras/d96bd5a15e4145402d090d7a4ce6ef21.avif?t=1771333565\" width=\"200\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">All Light is Life and all Life is Light. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every 100 years a darkness falls on Luxheim and the radiance of its inhabitants slowly fades away...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Carry the Pilgrim's Light and save Luxheim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829630/extras/d96bd5a15e4145402d090d7a4ce6ef21.avif?t=1771333565\" width=\"200\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore a vast world filled with platforming challenges, combat and puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find pieces of the story of Liturnia and discover what happened 100 years before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829630/extras/d96bd5a15e4145402d090d7a4ce6ef21.avif?t=1771333565\" width=\"200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This is a student game with a reduced scope from what was planned initially.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Discover a strange world inhabited by living lights. Liturnian is a 3D-Metroidvania with fluid movement, fights against strange creatures and exciting puzzles.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829630/ddc785126272d3e46645d15b4e64eece12eb72b5/header.jpg?t=1771333565", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Metroidvania", "3D Platformer", "Adventure", "3D", "Platformer", "Third Person"], "developers": "Solar Fish Games", "publishers": "Solar Fish Games", "release_date": "Feb 17, 2026", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "3829630", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "17 February 2026 - Free To Play", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/hN3Ewq07xLc", "first_seen": 1771282800.0, "review_rank": 1186}